<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CLAUSURA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CLAUSURA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
